@startuml
title RecruitmentRequest - Implemented Primary Lifecycle
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

[*] --> DRAFT
DRAFT --> PENDING_HR_REVIEW : Department Head submits\nUC-18
REVISION_NEEDED --> PENDING_HR_REVIEW : Department Head resubmits

PENDING_HR_REVIEW --> REVISION_NEEDED : HR returns for revision\nUC-20
PENDING_HR_REVIEW --> PENDING_BOSS_APPROVAL : HR forwards to Admin\nUC-22
PENDING_BOSS_APPROVAL --> REVISION_NEEDED : Admin requests changes\nUC-21
PENDING_BOSS_APPROVAL --> APPROVED : Admin approves\nUC-23
PENDING_BOSS_APPROVAL --> REJECTED : Admin rejects with reason\nUC-23

APPROVED --> PLANNING : HR creates OverallPlan\nUC-25
PLANNING --> PLAN_PENDING_APPROVAL : HR submits plan\nUC-26
PLAN_PENDING_APPROVAL --> PLANNING : Admin rejects plan with notes\nUC-27
PLAN_PENDING_APPROVAL --> PLAN_APPROVED : Admin approves plan\nUC-27
PLAN_APPROVED --> ACTIVE : HR starts campaign\nUC-28

ACTIVE --> SCREENING : candidate collection / CV screening
ACTIVE --> INTERVIEWING : first interview scheduled\nUC-46
SCREENING --> INTERVIEWING : interview scheduled
INTERVIEWING --> INTERVIEW_COMPLETED : panel result finalized\nUC-52
INTERVIEW_COMPLETED --> OFFER_EXTENDED : Admin HIRE decision\nUC-54
INTERVIEW_COMPLETED --> NOT_HIRED : Admin REJECT decision\nUC-54

OFFER_EXTENDED --> OFFER_ACCEPTED : Candidate accepts\nUC-56
OFFER_EXTENDED --> OFFER_DECLINED : Candidate declines\nUC-56
OFFER_ACCEPTED --> HIRED : candidate hired
HIRED --> COMPLETED : accepted hires reach headcount
OFFER_DECLINED --> ACTIVE : continue campaign if target remains
NOT_HIRED --> ACTIVE : continue campaign if target remains

DRAFT --> CANCELLED : permitted cancellation
ACTIVE --> CLOSED : administrative close
REJECTED --> [*]
COMPLETED --> [*]
CLOSED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

state PENDING_REVIEW #lightgray
note right of PENDING_REVIEW
Compatibility value retained for older records/clients.
New workflow uses PENDING_HR_REVIEW and PENDING_BOSS_APPROVAL.
end note
@enduml

